WEBVTT - MedVerse Pill Box (English)

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.460
One pill.
At a time.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Every time.

3
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.800
6 medicines.
3 times a day.

4
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.000
Who keeps count?
One missed or doubled dose can hurt.

5
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.960
Say hello to the
MedVerse Pill Box

6
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.450
Six medicines. One box. One pill at a time.

7
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Still a design
20 × 20 × 15.6 cm. English and Hindi.

8
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.500
Open it up.
Here is what is inside.

9
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.000
Top cover: closes with a magnet
Six lids: numbered, with a silica pocket
Six tanks: room for 86–102 ml each

10
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Six rotors: one pill per half-turn
Touch screen: big, clear reminders
Six small motors: one for each rotor

11
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Drawer: your pills land here

12
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.710
Wide tanks.
Pills slide down.

13
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.250
The floor is sloped, so every pill reaches the rotor.
To refill, you just pour. No picking.

14
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.960
Room for pills, per medicine
First design (round): 58 ml. This design (wedge): 102 ml.

15
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Worked out on a computer.
Not tried with real pills yet.

16
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.810
One turn.
One pill.

17
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.710
1. The rotor turns half a circle
2. Its pocket holds just one pill

18
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.810
3. The pill drops into the funnel
4. Two light beams count it

19
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.000
5. It lands in your drawer
1 pill

20
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.560
It checks, every time.
One pill. Counted and measured.

21
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.860
Two pills?
It stops and tells you.

22
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.160
None came out?
It tries again, up to 3 times.

23
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.000
It can spot a double. It cannot take it back.

24
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:45.610
Time for your medicine.
8:00 AM

25
00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.110
Reminder
Touch the screen

26
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:48.610
Cartridge 1: 1 pill
Cartridge 3: 2 pills

27
00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.110
Take your medicine
The pills drop into the drawer

28
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.000
Taken at 8:02 AM. All 3 pills were taken out.
The phone message is an idea.

29
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.960
Filling it is easy.
1. Lift the lid

30
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.960
2. Pour the pills in
3. Close it

31
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.000
You can lift a whole cartridge out
to clean it or to change the pill size.

32
00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.460
The basics.
20 × 20 × 15.6 cm: fits on a bedside table

33
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.860
6 medicines: one tank for each
86–102 ml each: room for pills, per medicine

34
00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.360
2.8″ touch screen: big, clear reminders
USB-C, rechargeable: charge it like a phone

35
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.000
EN + HI: two languages
Same as the app

36
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.110
MedVerse Pill Box

37
00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:07.410
It reminds you and gives the right pills. It is not a medical device.

38
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:09.360
Still a design. Not built or tested yet.

39
